{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794305498053,"sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_b18289a70bdc4626848e7215","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"find /workspace -type f -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | head -50"},"output":"/workspace/README.md\n/workspace/frontend/package.json\n/workspace/frontend/index.html\n/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts\n/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json\n/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n/workspace/backend/requirements.txt\n/workspace/backend/app.py\n/workspace/backend/requirements.lock\n/workspace/.dockerignore\n/workspace/Dockerfile\n","metadata":{"output":"/workspace/README.md\n/workspace/frontend/package.json\n/workspace/frontend/index.html\n/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts\n/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json\n/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx\n/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n/workspace/backend/requirements.txt\n/workspace/backend/app.py\n/workspace/backend/requirements.lock\n/workspace/.dockerignore\n/workspace/Dockerfile\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"find /workspace -type f -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.git/*' | head -50","time":{"start":1794305497690,"end":1794305497933}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c4f11a4e001cOqcpLAUWps3DZ","sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","messageID":"msg_1c4f10897001NSb1mW5ZGkInpl"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794305498053,"sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_e30a10e562e74feabcc20784","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat /workspace/README.md /workspace/Dockerfile 2>/dev/null"},"output":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\nFROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n","metadata":{"output":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\nFROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat /workspace/README.md /workspace/Dockerfile 2>/dev/null","time":{"start":1794305497723,"end":1794305497953}},"id":"prt_1c4f11a5e0015GqfsCcWtZRmEZ","sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","messageID":"msg_1c4f10897001NSb1mW5ZGkInpl"}}
