{"type":"text","timestamp":1794307103846,"sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","part":{"id":"prt_1c5099c4e001TMnVc1zdLHFy4u","messageID":"msg_1c509654c001pGSVHpHp2L3y7F","sessionID":"ses_e3b0efd89ffeAYD3w6ttov37XP","type":"text","text":"Done. Everything is built and verified.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`) — Flask + SQLite (`./data/library.db`):\n- `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 + `{\"token\"}`), Bearer-token auth (401 otherwise), passwords hashed with werkzeug\n- Books: paged `GET /api/books` (`q`, `page`, `page_size`, newest first, `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`), `POST`/`GET`/`PUT`/`DELETE` — `PUT` is a full replace (omitted/empty `year`/`isbn` cleared); delete cascades to reviews\n- Reviews: `GET /api/books/{id}/reviews` (`{\"items\":[...]}`, newest first), `POST` enforces one review per user per book\n- Book objects include `review_count` and `average_rating` (mean rounded half-up to 1 decimal, `null` with no reviews); errors return `{\"error\", \"message\"}` (400 validation incl. duplicate username/review, 401, 404); `GET /api/health` serves `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`\n- `requirements.txt` now carries the full hash-pinned set — pip cannot take hashes from the constraints file alone, so the Dockerfile's `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` would otherwise fail in hash mode (verified the exact command works)\n\n**Frontend** (`frontend/` — React 19 + TS + Vite + Tailwind v4, no hand-written CSS):\n- Header with signed-in username + sign out, register/sign-in forms\n- Book table (title/author/year/average rating) with search box and paging\n- Book page with reviews (username, rating stars, comment, date) and a review form for signed-in users (hidden once reviewed)\n- Add/edit book forms surfacing the API's validation messages; delete with confirmation; auth token kept in localStorage\n\nVerified end-to-end: `tsc --noEmit` clean, `npm ci` + `npm run build` (dist includes Tailwind utilities), the Dockerfile's pip command in a fresh venv, and a full API test run (auth, validation, paging, search, rounding `2.25→2.3`, cascade delete, SPA fallback) — all passed.","time":{"start":1794307103822,"end":1794307103826}}}
